{"question_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.2018b.q26", "exam": "NTCE", "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "zonghe", "source": {"type": "真题", "system": "国考", "session": "2018b", "paper": null, "variant": "全卷", "origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2018下半年教师资格考试《小学综合素质》真题及答案.csv", "verified": true}, "section": "单项选择题", "question_type": "单选", "material_id": null, "score": 2, "content": {"stem": "在 Excel 中，要通过扇形面积反应每个对象的一个属性值在总值当中所占比值大小，应该选择的图表类型是（ ）。", "options": [{"key": "A", "text": "柱形图"}, {"key": "B", "text": "折线图"}, {"key": "C", "text": "饼图"}, {"key": "D", "text": "XY散点图28下列选项中，与“红茶和绿茶”的逻辑关系相同的一组是（ ）。A、咖啡-吗啡B、陈醋-奶茶C、白酒-黄酒D、重水-雨水。"}], "answer": "C", "answer_status": "letter", "analysis": null}, "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m5.k3", "ntce.xiaoxue.zonghe.m5.k2"], "difficulty": null, "review": {"status": "待复核", "tagger": "rule-v1", "checked_by": null}, "extra": {"duplicate_of": null, "paper_order": 26}}
